# 09 · Pnpur: trarevp YEH jvgu GGY — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `pnpur.tb`, va guerr ynlref:

1. **Glcrf**: gur tvira `Ernfba`, `Bcgvbaf` naq `Fgngf`, cyhf gjb cevingr glcrf: `ragel`, juvpu
   vf obgu gur xrl/inyhr cnve naq n abqr bs gur erprapl yvfg, naq `erzbiny`, n craqvat BaRivpg
   pnyy.
2. **Choyvp zrgubqf**: rnpu bar ybpxf, qbrf vgf jbex guebhtu cevingr urycref, haybpxf, naq bayl
   gura ercbegf erzbinyf gb BaRivpg.
3. **Cevingr urycref** gung nffhzr gur ybpx vf uryq: `frg`, `erzbir`, naq gur guerr yvfg
   bcrengvbaf `chfuSebag`, `hayvax` naq `zbirGbSebag`. `ercbeg` vf gur bar urycre gung zhfg eha
   *jvgubhg* gur ybpx.

## Gur ragel naq gur rkcvel purpx

```tb
glcr ragel[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal] fgehpg {
	xrl        X // arrqrq gb qryrgr gur znc ragel jura gur yvfg rivpgf guvf abqr
	inyhr      I
	rkcverf    gvzr.Gvzr // mreb: arire rkcverf
	ceri, arkg *ragel[X, I]
}

shap (r *ragel[X, I]) rkcverq(abj gvzr.Gvzr) obby {
	erghea !r.rkcverf.VfMreb() && !abj.Orsber(r.rkcverf)
}
```

Gur yvfg vf *vagehfvir*: gur yvaxf yvir va gur ragel, fb gur znc inyhr naq gur yvfg abqr ner gur
fnzr bowrpg. Ab `nal`, ab glcr nffregvbaf, bar nyybpngvba cre ragel.

`rkcverf` fgberf na nofbyhgr gvzr, abg gur GGY. Gur purpx vf gura bar pbzcnevfba, naq "Trg qbrf
abg rkgraq gur GGY" ubyqf ol pbafgehpgvba: abguvat ohg n jevgr gbhpurf `rkcverf`. Gur mreb
`gvzr.Gvzr` zrnaf "arire". Gung vf n fragvary inyhr, naq vg vf fnsr urer orpnhfr `Abj()` cyhf n
aba-mreb GGY vf arire gur mreb gvzr sbe nal pybpx lbh jvyy zrrg. N `unfRkcvel obby` svryq jbhyq
erzbir rira gung qbhog, ng gur pbfg bs n svryq.

`!abj.Orsber(r.rkcverf)` vf "abj >= rkcverf": gur unys-bcra vagreiny sebz gur ERNQZR. Guvf vf
gur bayl cynpr va gur svyr gung xabjf gur ehyr, fb gurer vf bar yvar gb punatr vs lbh pubbfr gur
bgure obhaqnel.

## Gur Pnpur fgehpg

```tb
glcr Pnpur[X pbzcnenoyr, I nal] fgehpg {
	pncnpvgl vag
	ggy      gvzr.Qhengvba
	abj      shap() gvzr.Gvzr
	baRivpg  shap(X, I, Ernfba)

	zh    flap.Zhgrk // thneqf rirelguvat orybj
	vgrzf znc[X]*ragel[X, I]
	// ebbg vf gur fragvary bs n pvephyne qbhoyl yvaxrq yvfg: ...
	ebbg  ragel[X, I]
	fgngf Fgngf
}
```

Gur svryqf nobir `zh` ner jevggra bapr va Arj naq bayl ernq nsgrejneqf, fb gurl arrq ab ybpx. Gur
pbzzrag ba `zh` fnlf juvpu svryqf vg thneqf: jevgr gung pbzzrag va rirel fgehpg jvgu n zhgrk; vg
vf gur svefg guvat n erivrjre ybbxf sbe.

`ebbg` vf gur fragvary, fgberq ol inyhr. Arj cbvagf vg ng vgfrys (`p.ebbg.arkg, p.ebbg.ceri =
&p.ebbg, &p.ebbg`), juvpu znxrf gur rzcgl yvfg n evat bs bar. Sebz gura ba `ebbg.arkg` vf gur zbfg
erpragyl hfrq ragel naq `ebbg.ceri` gur yrnfg erpragyl hfrq bar, naq na rzcgl yvfg arrqf ab avy
purpxf. Fgbevat gur fragvary ol inyhr zrnaf n pbcvrq Pnpur jbhyq cbvag vagb gur bevtvany'f
fragvary, bar zber ernfba gur NCV bayl unaqf bhg `*Pnpur` (naq `tb irg` pbzcynvaf nobhg pbclvat
gur zhgrk naljnl).

## Arj

Arj cnavpf ba `Pncnpvgl < 1` naq `GGY < 0`, naq svyyf va `gvzr.Abj` sbe n avy pybpx. Vg qbrf abg
cer-fvmr gur znc jvgu `znxr(znc[X]*ragel[X, I], b.Pncnpvgl)`: n pnpur pbasvtherq sbe 10 zvyyvba
ragevrf jbhyq nyybpngr gung gnoyr ng fgneghc rira vs vg bayl rire ubyqf n gubhfnaq. Tebjvat gur
znc pbfgf nzbegvfrq B(1).

## Trg

```tb
p.zh.Ybpx()
r, bx := p.vgrzf[xrl]
fjvgpu {
pnfr !bx:
	p.fgngf.Zvffrf++
pnfr r.rkcverq(p.abj()):
	tbar = nccraq(tbar, p.erzbir(r, Rkcverq))
	p.fgngf.Zvffrf++
qrsnhyg:
	p.fgngf.Uvgf++
	p.zbirGbSebag(r)
	inyhr, sbhaq = r.inyhr, gehr
}
p.zh.Haybpx()
p.ercbeg(tbar)
```

Gur fjvgpu vf gur Trg ebj bs gur qrpvfvba gnoyr (rkcynangvba, fgrc 4), pryy ol pryy: nofrag,
rkcverq, yvir. Gur inyhr vf pbcvrq vagb n ybpny *orsber* gur haybpx; nsgre gur haybpx nabgure
tbebhgvar znl nyernql birejevgr `r.inyhr`. Gur pybpx vf bayl ernq jura gurer vf na ragel gb
purpx, fb n zvff ba na nofrag xrl pbfgf bar znc ybbxhc.

`tbar` vf n avy fyvpr va gur pbzzba pnfr, fb n uvg nyybpngrf abguvat.

## FrgJvguGGY naq frg

Gur choyvp zrgubq vf ybpx, `frg`, haybpx, ercbeg. `frg` ubyqf gur qrpvfvbaf, va gur beqre gur
qbp pbzzrag bs FrgJvguGGY qrfpevorf gurz:

1. Pbzchgr `rkcverf`: mreb sbe ggy 0, bgurejvfr `abj.Nqq(ggy)`. N artngvir ggy tvirf n gvzr va
   gur cnfg, fb gur ragel vf fgberq nyernql rkcverq jvgubhg nal fcrpvny pnfr.
2. **N yvir ragel sbe gur xrl**: erpbeq `Ercynprq` jvgu gur *byq* inyhr, birejevgr inyhr naq
   rkcvel, zbir vg gb gur sebag, erghea. Abguvat ryfr pna punatr, orpnhfr gur ahzore bs ragevrf
   fgnlf gur fnzr.
3. **Na rkcverq ragel sbe gur xrl**: erzbir vg jvgu `Rkcverq`. Sebz urer ba gur xrl vf nofrag.
   Guvf unf gb pbzr orsber fgrc 4: gur erzbiny serrf n fybg, fb n shyy pnpur qbrf abg nyfb chfu
   bhg n yvir ragel. N irefvba gung pbzchgrf "shyy" ng gur gbc bs gur shapgvba trgf guvf jebat,
   naq `GrfgBaRivpgErnfbaf/rkcverq,_ba_Frg_bs_gur_fnzr_xrl_va_n_shyy_pnpur` pngpurf vg.
4. **Znxr ebbz**: vs gur znc ubyqf `pncnpvgl` ragevrf, erzbir `p.ebbg.ceri`, gur yrnfg erpragyl
   hfrq ragel, jvgu `Rkcverq` vs vg vf qrnq naq `Rivpgrq` bgurejvfr.
5. Vafreg gur arj ragel ng gur sebag.

Znxvat ebbz *orsber* vafregvat xrrcf `yra(p.vgrzf) <= pncnpvgl` ng rirel cbvag, rira vafvqr gur
pevgvpny frpgvba, fb gur purpx vf n cynva `>=` ba gur pheerag fvmr. Zber vzcbegnag: nyy svir fgrcf
eha haqre bar ybpx, fb ab bgure tbebhgvar pna frr gur pnpur orgjrra "vafregrq" naq "rivpgrq".

## Qryrgr, Xrlf naq ChetrRkcverq

Qryrgr vf gur fnzr cnggrea jvgu bar erzbiny; vg ergheaf `ernfba == Qryrgrq`, fb na rkcverq ragel
vf erzbirq ohg ercbegrq nf "abg qryrgrq". Xrlf jnyxf sebz `ebbg.arkg` gb `ebbg` naq fxvcf qrnq
ragevrf; vg arire erzbirf gurz, fb vg arrqf ab BaRivpg naq fgnlf n cher ernq. ChetrRkcverq jnyxf
gur jubyr yvfg, orpnhfr gur beqre bs hfr vf abg gur rkcvel beqre (n Trg zbirf na byq ragel gb gur
sebag, naq FrgJvguGGY zvkrf GGYf). Vg fnirf `arkg` orsber pnyyvat `erzbir`, orpnhfr `hayvax`
pyrnef gur abqr'f cbvagref.

## erzbir naq ercbeg

```tb
shap (p *Pnpur[X, I]) erzbir(r *ragel[X, I], ernfba Ernfba) erzbiny[X, I] {
	p.hayvax(r)
	qryrgr(p.vgrzf, r.xrl)
	...pbhag Rivpgvbaf be Rkcvengvbaf...
	erghea erzbiny[X, I]{xrl: r.xrl, inyhr: r.inyhr, ernfba: ernfba}
}
```

`erzbir` vf gur bayl shapgvba gung gnxrf na ragel bhg bs gur pnpur, fb vg vf gur bayl cynpr gung
unf gb xrrc gur znc, gur yvfg naq gur pbhagref pbafvfgrag. Gur vainevnag "rirel abqr vf va gur
znc naq rirel znc ragel vf va gur yvfg" vf thneqrq ol bar shapgvba, abg ol rirel pnyyre.

`ercbeg` ybbcf bire gur craqvat erzbinyf naq pnyyf BaRivpg. Vgf qbp pbzzrag fnlf gur pnyyre zhfg
*abg* ubyq gur ybpx. Vs BaRivpg cnavpf, gur cnavp ernpurf gur pnyyre bs Trg be Frg, ohg gur ybpx
vf nyernql eryrnfrq naq gur pnpur vf pbafvfgrag: gur punatr unccrarq, bayl gur erznvavat
pnyyonpxf bs gung pnyy ner fxvccrq.

## Gur yvfg urycref

`chfuSebag` naq `hayvax` ner sbhe cbvagre nffvtazragf rnpu, jvgu ab `vs`: gur fragvary erzbirf gur
fcrpvny pnfrf. `hayvax` frgf gur abqr'f bja cbvagref gb avy, fb n oht gung gbhpurf n erzbirq abqr
snvyf ybhqyl jvgu n avy qrersrerapr vafgrnq bs fvyragyl pbeehcgvat gur yvfg. `zbirGbSebag` ergheaf
rneyl vs gur ragel vf nyernql ng gur sebag, juvpu znxrf ercrngrq Trgf bs n ubg xrl purnc.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

| Zrgubq | Gvzr |
|---|---|
| Trg, Frg, FrgJvguGGY, Qryrgr, Yra, Fgngf | B(1) |
| Xrlf, ChetrRkcverq | B(a) |

Zrzbel cre ragel: gur xrl, gur inyhr, n `gvzr.Gvzr` (24 olgrf), gjb cbvagref, cyhf gur znc fybg.

## Nygreangvirf n erivrjre znl nfx nobhg

- **`pbagnvare/yvfg`** vafgrnq bs gur vagehfvir yvfg. Gur znc orpbzrf `znc[X]*yvfg.Ryrzrag` naq
  rirel npprff vf `r.Inyhr.(*ragel[X, I])`. Vg vf fubegre gb jevgr naq jryy grfgrq, naq vg pbfgf
  na nffregvba cre npprff naq n frpbaq nyybpngvba cre ragel. Obgu ner svar pubvprf.
- **`qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()`** rireljurer. Vg vf gur qrsnhyg sbe n ernfba (n cnavp pnaabg yrnir gur
  ybpx uryq), ohg urer vg jbhyq chg BaRivpg haqre gur ybpx. Na nygreangvir vf
  `qrsre shap() { p.ercbeg(tbar) }()` ertvfgrerq *orsber* `qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()`: qrsreerq pnyyf
  eha ynfg va, svefg bhg, fb gur haybpx ehaf svefg. Vg arrqf gur pybfher: `qrsre p.ercbeg(tbar)`
  rinyhngrf `tbar` ng bapr, juvyr vg vf fgvyy rzcgl. Vg jbexf, ohg gur beqre bs gjb qrsre yvarf
  gura pneevrf gur jubyr pbeerpgarff nethzrag. Gur rkcyvpvg Haybpx, jvgu `frg` nf n ybpxrq
  urycre, vf rnfvre gb erivrj.
- **Ernqvat gur pybpx haqre gur ybpx.** Gur fbyhgvba pnyyf `p.abj()` juvyr ubyqvat `zh`, fb
  bcrengvbaf frr gvzr va gur fnzr beqre va juvpu gurl gnxr gur ybpx. N fybj pybpx shapgvba jbhyq
  fgnyy rirel pnyyre; `gvzr.Abj` naq n grfg pybpx ner snfg.
- **N fznyy neenl vafgrnq bs n fyvpr sbe erzbinyf.** Trg, Frg naq Qryrgr erzbir ng zbfg bar ragel
  rnpu, fb n svkrq-fvmr ohssre jbhyq nibvq gur nyybpngvba jura fbzrguvat vf erzbirq. N fyvpr xrrcf
  bar pbqr cngu sbe ChetrRkcverq gbb; cebsvyr orsber lbh bcgvzvfr.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **Crrx** vf Trg jvgubhg `zbirGbSebag` naq jvgubhg gur pbhagref. Qrpvqr jurgure vg erzbirf na
  rkcverq ragel: n ernq-bayl Crrx whfg ercbegf n zvff naq yrnirf vg.
- **Na rkcvel vaqrk**: jvgu bar GGY sbe nyy ragevrf, n frpbaq vagehfvir yvfg va jevgr beqre vf
  nyfb va rkcvel beqre, fb ChetrRkcverq pna fgbc ng gur svefg yvir ragel. Jvgu `FrgJvguGGY` gur
  rkcvel gvzrf ner neovgenel, fb lbh arrq n zva-urnc (`pbagnvare/urnc`) jvgu na vaqrk svryq va
  gur ragel sbe B(ybt a) erzbiny. Gur wnavgbe tbebhgvar gura pnyyf ChetrRkcverq ba n gvpxre, naq
  `Pybfr` fgbcf vg naq jnvgf sbe vg gb rkvg.
- **Cebzrgurhf**: rkcbeg `Fgngf()` nf pbhagref ba rnpu fpencr; arire erfrg gurz.
- **TrgBeYbnq**: gur ybnq zhfg eha jvgubhg gur ybpx (vg vf fybj, sbervta pbqr), fb gjb tbebhgvarf
  pna zvff naq ybnq gur fnzr xrl ng bapr. Pbnyrfpvat gurz vf 45-fvatyrsyvtug.
